      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I understand the issue. It seems that SOC change is the trigger for some failure? Either the SOC becomes 100% and therefore the 5V limit is applied, or otherwise it\u0027s removed. It seems as it\u0027s working as expected?\n\nIs there another bug you can mention in the commit message?",
      "revId": "ab21d0cc5e56b45572343e7206b86973e6d7a785",
